    "paragraphs": [
      "Co-founded by Maxwell Frank and Tye French, Ridgeline Productions is a full-service production company based in Santa Barbara, California.",
      "With over a decade of experience traveling the globe, we produce, direct, and create authentic brand campaigns and commercial films for startups, major corporations, and agencies alike."
    ],
    "emphasis": "Every project is tailored. Every frame is intentional.",
    "stats": [
      {
        "count": 15,
        "label": "Years Experience"
      },
      {
        "count": 50,
        "label": "Projects Delivered"
      },
      {
        "count": 30,
        "label": "Brand Partners"
      }
    ],
    "philosophy": "We don't just capture moments — we craft stories that move people. Every frame is a choice. Every cut is deliberate. From the peaks of Patagonia to the streets of LA, we bring brands to life through visuals that resonate, inspire, and endure."
  },
