    },
    {
      "id": "production",
      "number": "02",
      "name": "Production",
      "description": "We embrace being a focused, agile team. As a direct-to-director field production company, we're involved from concept through delivery — ensuring care, precision, and creative alignment at every stage. Ridgeline is a scalable production partner built to bring ideas to life, supported by a global network of producers, directors, and cinematographers.",
